  "details": "It's nice that we get notifications for when we're subscribed to an event, but I also want to send notifications to my entire group, an hour before and a day before the event starts.\n\nIt would be great if we could schedule announcements to be sent at a later time, so that I don't have to set an alarm to send announcements each time I need it to be sent. Instead, I could just schedule announcements ALL AT ONCE to be sent a day before and an hour before.",
